      "after": "Row II needs (y-2)^2-3(y-2)+9=y^2-7y+19. Row III needs (x+3)^2+4(x+3)+16=x^2+10x+37; omitting +6x gives x^2+4x+37. At x=2 the candidate product is 49 instead of the original 61."
